[89.273693, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255msingle plain unstyled HTML button labeled 'Get Started'. Critique it using impeccable's guidance, \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mthen restyle it in-place into a polished, accessible button with good color contrast, focus ring, \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mhover state, and semantic markup. Finally, print a one-line summary of the improvements you made. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll activate the impeccable skill first, then work through the task.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"impeccable\" activated inline. Following ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll start by running the impeccable context command as the skill requires.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(/tmp/tmp.6cGncIOHVY/tests/oracle/workspaces/ctx...) 4.2s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll run the impeccable context command as the skill requires. Let me locate the active skill\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kdirectory first.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(VERSION) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KContext loaded. This is a narrow, self-contained refinement with a clear brief, so I'll proceed\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kdirectly rather than run the full init/new-work interview. Let me first read impeccable's quality\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kfloor and critique guidance before touching any UI.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(=== craft-floor.md ===) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;136m|\u001b[