[193.913482, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8"]
[193.913761, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KDetector returns clean ([]) \u2014 it checks markup anti-patterns, not aesthetic emptiness, so an\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kunstyled button passes it. The real deficiencies are design-review (Assessment A) findings against\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kthe craft floor.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mCritique of the plain button (impeccable guidance)\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KJudged against craft-floor.md, the bare <button>Get Started</button> fails most checks:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mContrast / color:\u001b[22m relies on the UA default (light gray on near-black) \u2014 undefined across browsers\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kand not a decision. No committed foreground/background.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mStates:\u001b[22m no :hover, :focus-visible, :active, or disabled treatment. The default focus ring is the\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kbrowser's, \"a ring that belongs to no design system\" \u2014 exactly the browser-surface tell the floor\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kcalls out.\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[1mDepth & spacing:\u001b[22m no padding rhythm, no authored elevation \u2014 just the UA chrome.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mType:\u001b[22m inherits the UA font stack at ~13px; no weight, size, or tracking decision.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mMotion:\u001b[22m none \u2014 no authored transition on state change.\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[1mSemantics:\u001b[22m <button> lacks an explicit type (defaults to submit, a footgun outside a form); page\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Klacks viewport; it's a floating control with no accessible grouping or landmark.\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[1mBrowser surfaces:\u001b[22m caret/selection/focus all ship as defaults.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KIt's a\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u